The statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of the statute[[cite:obs-dc5c8852cd2ced9d2a94844c352b73a08d32abd7 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years and are shredded afterwards[[cite:obs-75ad4d661f69b0f44258052fff2f58bad856c204 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].
